 "text": "Hey there! How's your day? Totally normal in a big event. Tense muscles usually pass in a few days. Pop a few of those and try to rest your wrists as much as you can. A slight bend in your wrists helps too. That's really normal. Try focus on something familiar, like the back of the hall, so your mind wanders less. And try take deep breaths and focus on the sound of music, it helps calm the eggs. She' love you for helping her plan too. Lots of small gestures go a long way.",
